<title>UK: London gold fixes little changed, PGMs easier.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes little changed, PGMs easier.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixes virtually unchanged at $319.80 versus $319.65 AM. Consolidating after bounce from Monday's lows. But meeting resistance just above $320.00.</p>
<p>SILVER - Holding steady at one cent lower $4.32/$4.34.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Easier at $395.00/$399.00, down $3.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Down sharply at $161.00/$165.00, off $5.00.</p>
<p>Discounted after confirmation of Russian supplies to Japan.</p>
</text>
